aced Combat</h2>Immersive hack and slash combat and satisfying combos<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601700/extras/c88881c87ab9da19a07b1a1b70d72931.poster.avif?t=1680358203\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601700/extras/c88881c87ab9da19a07b1a1b70d72931.webm?t=1680358203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601700/extras/c88881c87ab9da19a07b1a1b70d72931.mp4?t=1680358203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skills</h2>Discover new skills depending on how you play the game, so you can make each run unique<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601700/extras/fb999c29630df5fbdc2b6b22309def88.poster.avif?t=1680358203\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601700/extras/fb999c29630df5fbdc2b6b22309def88.webm?t=1680358203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601700/extras/fb999c29630df5fbdc2b6b22309def88.mp4?t=1680358203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >story</h2>The Golden God is soon to be left out of his prison. The blood moon rises as the believers pray for salvation... <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601700/extras/a1f366b84b7556f7729462efe7e0ce82.poster.avif?t=1680358203\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601700/extras/a1f366b84b7556f7729462efe7e0ce82.webm?t=16